# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:12
translate turkish ss1_cdbb8564:

    # "Ms. Welch starts class by handing out the tests that we did the previous week."
    "Bayan Welch, dersi önceki hafta yaptığımız testleri dağıtarak başlatıyor."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:13
translate turkish ss1_5d9d5d63:

    # gg "How did you do?"
    gg "Nasıl gitti?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:14
translate turkish ss1_0dbc34a9:

    # pc "I aced it. Perfect A+"
    pc "Tam not aldım. Mükemmel bir A+"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:16
translate turkish ss1_9872da7c:

    # gg "Wow, nice! I might need to study with you sometime."
    gg "Vay canına, harika! Bir ara seninle ders çalışmam gerekebilir."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:20
translate turkish ss1_edc93756:

    # "She turns back to the front and then Ms. Welch starts lecturing."
    "Öne dönüyor ve Bayan Welch derse başlıyor."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:23
translate turkish ss1_ac33b73f:

    # gg "Can't wait."
    gg "Sabırsızlanıyorum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:24
translate turkish ss1_34213f63:

    # "After that, Ms. Welch starts lecturing and we both turn to the front and try to stay awake."
    "Bundan sonra Bayan Welch derse başlar ve ikimiz de öne döneriz, uyanık kalmaya çalışırız."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:28
translate turkish ss1_38327323:

    # "Ms. Welch goes on and on about the questions that were missed the most on the test."
    "Bayan Welch, sınavda en çok yanlış yapılan sorular hakkında durmadan konuşur."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:29
translate turkish ss1_60ee67bc:

    # "Then she starts in on what we will be covering with the next test which will be next week."
    "Sonra gelecek hafta yapılacak bir sonraki sınavda işleyeceğimiz konulara geçer."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:30
translate turkish ss1_18c2b08f:

    # "I try to pay attention, but it's hard when I really just don't care about the subject matter at all, and my mind is going everywhere else."
    "Dikkatimi vermeye çalışıyorum ama konuyla hiç ilgilenmediğim ve aklım başka yerlerde dolaştığı için bu çok zor."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:32
translate turkish ss1_b4a5181e:

    # "I think about my dad. I think about work. I think about what Ms. Welch would look like without that dress on."
    "Babamı düşünüyorum. İşi düşünüyorum. Bayan Welch’in o elbiseyi giymese nasıl görüneceğini düşünüyorum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:34
translate turkish ss1_5a4862a5:

    # sst "Right, [pcname]?"
    sst "Değil mi, [pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:38
translate turkish ss1_b0461cd6:

    # sst "Good, I'll see you there."
    sst "Güzel, orada görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:40
translate turkish ss1_4b943e43:

    # pc "Uh, what did I just agree to?"
    pc "Ee, az önce neye razı oldum ben?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:41
translate turkish ss1_f0083f96:

    # gg "You agreed to go to the courtyard this evening to help her register voters."
    gg "Bu akşam avluya gidip seçmen kaydı yapmasına yardım etmeyi kabul ettin."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:42
translate turkish ss1_0e03a1ab:

    # pc "Oh God. I don't want to do that."
    pc "Aman Tanrım. Bunu yapmak istemiyorum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:43
translate turkish ss1_5684dd44:

    # gg "Then why did you agree to it?"
    gg "O zaman neden kabul ettin?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:44
translate turkish ss1_51548651:

    # pc "I don't know. I wasn't listening."
    pc "Bilmiyorum. Dinlemiyordun."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:47
translate turkish ss1_c2ff44a1:

    # sst "Uhh?"
    sst "Uhh?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:48
translate turkish ss1_d43b4dca:

    # sst "I expect you to pay attention in class, [pcname]."
    sst "Derste dikkatini vermeni bekliyorum, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:50
translate turkish ss1_2e379803:

    # sst "I was talking about how important it is to vote."
    sst "Oy vermenin ne kadar önemli olduğundan bahsediyordum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:51
translate turkish ss1_ef5f7136:

    # sst "And how myself and a group of students are going to be in the courtyard later this evening registering students to vote."
    sst "Ve bu akşam geç saatlerde bir grup öğrenciyle birlikte avluda öğrencilerin oy kullanabilmesi için kayıt yapacağımızdan."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:53
translate turkish ss1_03dfffcf:

    # sst "And since you can't keep focused in class, I expect you to be there to help."
    sst "Ve derste dikkatini toplayamadığına göre, orada yardım etmeni bekliyorum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:54
translate turkish ss1_3a72700b:

    # sst "You will be there, won't you, [pcname]."
    sst "Orada olacaksın, değil mi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:55
translate turkish ss1_403d0486:

    # pc "I'll be there."
    pc "Orada olacağım."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:57
translate turkish ss1_3807a033:

    # sst "Good."
    sst "Güzel."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:58
translate turkish ss1_50770a51:

    # sst "I'll see you then."
    sst "O zaman görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:60
translate turkish ss1_eb0964ca:

    # sst "And if anybody else wants to join [pcname] and I, you are all invited to come help."
    sst "Ve eğer [pcname] ve bana katılmak isteyen başka biri varsa, hepiniz yardım etmeye davetlisiniz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:63
translate turkish ss1_84ba533b:

    # sst "At least he's honest."
    sst "En azından dürüst."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:65
translate turkish ss1_2e379803_1:

    # sst "I was talking about how important it is to vote."
    sst "Oy vermenin ne kadar önemli olduğundan bahsediyordum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:66
translate turkish ss1_ef5f7136_1:

    # sst "And how myself and a group of students are going to be in the courtyard later this evening registering students to vote."
    sst "Ve bu akşam geç saatlerde bir grup öğrenciyle birlikte avluda öğrencileri oy vermeye kaydettireceğimizi."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:68
translate turkish ss1_03dfffcf_1:

    # sst "And since you can't keep focused in class, I expect you to be there to help."
    sst "Ve derslerde dikkatinizi toplayamadığınıza göre, orada yardım etmenizi bekliyorum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:69
translate turkish ss1_3a72700b_1:

    # sst "You will be there, won't you, [pcname]."
    sst "Orada olacaksın, değil mi, [pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:70
translate turkish ss1_403d0486_1:

    # pc "I'll be there."
    pc "Ben de orada olacağım."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:72
translate turkish ss1_3807a033_1:

    # sst "Good."
    sst "Güzel."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:73
translate turkish ss1_50770a51_1:

    # sst "I'll see you then."
    sst "O zaman görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:75
translate turkish ss1_eb0964ca_1:

    # sst "And if anybody else wants to join [pcname] and I, you are all invited to come help."
    sst "Ve eğer [pcname] ile bana katılmak isteyen başka biri varsa, hepiniz gelip yardım etmeye davetlisiniz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:77
translate turkish ss1_a769540c:

    # gg "Sucks for you, dude."
    gg "Senin için kötü oldu dostum."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:78
translate turkish ss1_c417e350:

    # pc "Yeah."
    pc "Evet."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:80
translate turkish ss1_1d646551:

    # gg "Tell you what. I'll come too."
    gg "Bak ne diyeceğim. Ben de geleceğim."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:81
translate turkish ss1_cd618635:

    # pc "Really? Why?"
    pc "Gerçekten mi? Neden?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:82
translate turkish ss1_cbeac2d3:

    # gg "I don't know. It seems like it might be interesting."
    gg "Bilmiyorum. İlginç olabilir gibi görünüyor."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:83
translate turkish ss1_cae70c89:

    # pc "Seems boring as hell to me."
    pc "Bana çok sıkıcı geliyor."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:85
translate turkish ss1_a1df2b90:

    # gg "Maybe. Or maybe we can make it fun?"
    gg "Belki. Ya da belki eğlenceli hale getirebiliriz?"

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:86
translate turkish ss1_6feb1c79:

    # pc "Alright then. I'll see you there."
    pc "Tamam o zaman. Orada görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:87
translate turkish ss1_6e8791fa:

    # gg "Yeah. See you there."
    gg "Evet. Orada görüşürüz."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:89
translate turkish ss1_54ca6c92:

    # "Eventually, Ms. Welch finishes her lecture and I go on to the next class."
    "Sonunda Bayan Welch dersini bitirir ve ben bir sonraki derse geçerim."

# game/Scenes/School/SocialStudies/ss1.rpy:90
translate turkish ss1_470e54a6:

    # "Nothing else interesting happens the rest of the day, then I head to work."
    "Günün geri kalanında ilginç bir şey olmaz, sonra işe giderim."

